{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00348",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.84,
      "end_seconds": 5.96,
      "duration_seconds": 5.12,
      "text": "I mean, hi there, is it alright if I come in now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.77,
      "end_seconds": 11.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "Yes, come in, take a seat. What can I do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.39,
      "end_seconds": 14.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "I've been feeling anxious most of the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 15.27,
      "end_seconds": 18.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "How long has this been going on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.84,
      "end_seconds": 30.59,
      "duration_seconds": 7.75,
      "text": "Probably about a month. Yeah. I've been feeling on edge too. With feeling on edge, it's severe, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.04,
      "end_seconds": 45.52,
      "duration_seconds": 13.48,
      "text": "I'll be straight with you about how this works. Most of what we see in clinic turns out to be manageable, and the history you give me is often more useful than any single test, so thank you for being so detailed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.36,
      "end_seconds": 48.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Thank you, that really helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.36,
      "end_seconds": 52.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Any low mood, alcohol use or thoughts of harming myself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.25,
      "end_seconds": 58.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "No, no low mood, alcohol use or thoughts of harming myself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.38,
      "end_seconds": 61.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "Are you on any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.87,
      "end_seconds": 65.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "No, I don't take anything regularly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.93,
      "end_seconds": 81.27,
      "duration_seconds": 14.34,
      "text": "Let me explain how I'm thinking about this. When someone has symptoms like these, we first look for the common and treatable causes, and only then for the rarer ones. That's why I'm going step by step rather than ordering everything at once."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.31,
      "end_seconds": 86.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.06,
      "end_seconds": 91.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.87,
      "end_seconds": 94.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "No, nothing I'm aware of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.62,
      "end_seconds": 98.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Is it okay if I type while we talk?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.7,
      "end_seconds": 101.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "Yes, of course, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.3,
      "end_seconds": 105.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.57,
      "end_seconds": 109.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "No, I've never had anything serious."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.97,
      "end_seconds": 113.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Do you have everything you need to get home alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.71,
      "end_seconds": 126.8,
      "duration_seconds": 13.09,
      "text": "Yes, I've got my transport sorted. It's a bit of a trek, but I'm used to the journey by now, and I brought something to read for the wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.67,
      "end_seconds": 128.62,
      "duration_seconds": 0.95,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.49,
      "end_seconds": 132.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "I smoke about ten cigarettes a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.05,
      "end_seconds": 136.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.52,
      "text": "And alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.63,
      "end_seconds": 141.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "A beer or two most evenings, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.58,
      "end_seconds": 144.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.76,
      "end_seconds": 147.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "No operations, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.26,
      "end_seconds": 151.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "Let's get your blood pressure and the other basics."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.53,
      "end_seconds": 162.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "Just relax your arm..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.37,
      "end_seconds": 181.84,
      "duration_seconds": 6.47,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 119 over 70, oxygen saturation is 98 percent, temperature 36.9, pulse is 76 beats a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.15,
      "end_seconds": 186.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "Let me just pull up your file for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 187.5,
      "end_seconds": 188.2,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 197.54,
      "end_seconds": 198.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.42,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.21,
      "end_seconds": 202.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Can I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 204.07,
      "end_seconds": 204.77,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.61,
      "end_seconds": 208.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "Now bend it for me, slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.18,
      "end_seconds": 229.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Pulse is regular and you're breathing comfortably right now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.36,
      "end_seconds": 241.7,
      "duration_seconds": 10.34,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Thank you for that. I'll write up what I found in a moment, and then I'll tell you what I think is going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.94,
      "end_seconds": 247.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "Let me make a quick note of that before I forget."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 247.65,
      "end_seconds": 248.35,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.82,
      "end_seconds": 287.15,
      "duration_seconds": 25.33,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Right, here's what I'm thinking. I think we're dealing with an anxiety disorder at this stage. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've been feeling anxious most of the day for about a month, and no alcohol use or thoughts of harming myself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 287.78,
      "end_seconds": 289.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "Yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.15,
      "end_seconds": 306.37,
      "duration_seconds": 16.22,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange an ECG for palpitations. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step. I'll start you on escitalopram, 5 milligrams, once a day, for two weeks then review. You take it by mouth. That should help with anxiety."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 306.95,
      "end_seconds": 308.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "Right, I'll remember that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.2,
      "end_seconds": 337.82,
      "duration_seconds": 26.62,
      "text": "Regular exercise and less caffeine make a real difference. Slow breathing, in for four and out for six, for a few minutes whenever it builds up. Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit. We'll refer you to a counsellor. Keep an eye out, and if you have thoughts of harming yourself, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 339.14,
      "end_seconds": 340.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "Come back in four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 341.42,
      "end_seconds": 343.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "Okay, I'll book that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 344.24,
      "end_seconds": 351.07,
      "duration_seconds": 6.83,
      "text": "Just so I know I've explained it clearly, can you tell me the plan back in your own words?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 351.69,
      "end_seconds": 359.94,
      "duration_seconds": 8.25,
      "text": "So, I take the escitalopram, 5 milligrams, once a day and come back in four weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 360.69,
      "end_seconds": 366.59,
      "duration_seconds": 5.9,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Right, that's all I have. Is there anything you wanted to ask?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 367.62,
      "end_seconds": 370.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "No, you've explained it well. Thanks."
    }
  ]
}